<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy!</font>

53
00:02:37,720 --> 00:02:38,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nii-san...</font>

54
00:02:40,050 --> 00:02:41,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Today...</font>

55
00:02:41,720 --> 00:02:44,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when school's over,
help me train for a Shuriken Jutsu...</font>

56
00:02:45,810 --> 00:02:50,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm busy... Have father teach you.</font>

57
00:02:51,480 --> 00:02:55,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you're better at Shuriken Jutsu,
nii-san...</font>

58
00:02:56,530 --> 00:02:57,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even I can see that.</font>

59
00:02:59,030 --> 00:03:02,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You always treat me
like a pest, nii-san.</font>

60
00:03:14,090 --> 00:03:15,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ouch!</font>

61
00:03:17,260 --> 00:03:20,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Forgive me Sasuke...
Some other time, okay?</font>

62
00:03:36,070 --> 00:03:38,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't have time to
pay attention to you today.</font>

63
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:45,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're always jabbing my forehead
and saying "Forgive me, Sasuke."</font>

64
00:03:45,910 --> 00:03:49,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You also say "not today,"
but there's never a day.</font>

65
00:04:00,340 --> 00:04:01,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Father.</font>

66
00:04:01,470 --> 00:04:02,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

67
00:04:02,260 --> 00:04:06,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why doesn't nii-san
pay any attention to me?</font>

68
00:04:09,430 --> 00:04:12,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy's a little strange...</font>

69
00:04:13,480 --> 00:04:17,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's the type that doesn't really like
to become intimate with people.</font>

70
00:04:18,190 --> 00:04:19,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?</font>

71
00:04:21,150 --> 00:04:22,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know.</font>

72
00:04:23,530 --> 00:04:28,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am his father and
still I can't read that boy...</font>

73
00:04:29,700 --> 00:04:30,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here!</font>

74
00:04:30,540 --> 00:04:32,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your boxed lunch, Sasuke!</font>

75
00:04:32,500 --> 00:04:34,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're worried about doing
Shuriken Jutsu practice,</font>

76
00:04:34,080 --> 00:04:36,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will watch you when you get home.</font>

77
00:04:38,170 --> 00:04:40,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're not practices,
they're training!</font>

78
00:04:42,590 --> 00:04:44,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See you later!</font>

79
00:04:49,140 --> 00:04:51,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-chan, are you on
your way to school?</font>

80
00:04:51,850 --> 00:04:53,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

81
00:04:53,350 --> 00:04:56,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I saw Itachi-chan earlier on.
He's really become a man.</font>

82
00:04:57,060 --> 00:04:59,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's already a top-notch Shinobi.</font>

83
00:04:59,860 --> 00:05:02,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He graduated at the head of his class
at the Academy at the age of seven,</font>

84
00:05:02,860 --> 00:05:05,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and attained Chunin level
at the age of ten, didn't he?</font>

85
00:05:06,530 --> 00:05:09,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He became adept at using
Sharingan at the age of eight.</font>

86
00:05:11,450 --> 00:05:13,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, I remember.</font>

87
00:05:13,540 --> 00:05:17,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That boy is truly
the pride of the Uchiha clan.</font>

88
00:05:18,500 --> 00:05:21,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the way,
how old are you now, Sasuke-chan?</font>

89
00:05:23,970 --> 00:05:27,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm the same age as
when nii-san graduated,</font>

90
00:05:28,050 --> 00:05:29,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but I can't...</font>

91
00:05:29,930 --> 00:05:31,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter?</font>

92
00:05:31,260 --> 00:05:32,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

93
00:05:32,890 --> 00:05:35,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop talking nonsense!</font>

94
00:05:35,430 --> 00:05:36,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh my, dear.</font>

95
00:05:37,900 --> 00:05:41,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke, both you and Itachi
come from the same Uchiha clan,</font>

96
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:43,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the pedigree of
the Hidden Leaf Village.</font>

97
00:05:44,030 --> 00:05:45,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Have confidence!</font>

98
00:05:45,950 --> 00:05:49,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll be an amazing
Shinobi just like Itachi one day.</font>

99
00:05:50,700 --> 00:05:51,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

100
00:05:52,330 --> 00:05:53,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See you later!</font>

101
00:05:54,160 --> 00:05:55,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do your best!</font>

102
00:05:55,750 --> 00:05:57,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Study hard!</font>

103
00:06:07,760 --> 00:06:09,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right...</font>

104
00:06:09,180 --> 00:06:12,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I come from the same Uchiha clan
as nii-san...</font>

105
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:22,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't lose to nii-san!</font>

106
00:06:35,660 --> 00:06:37,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm pretty late...</font>

107
00:07:05,320 --> 00:07:06,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What was that?</font>

108
00:07:06,650 --> 00:07:08,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I had the feeling
there was someone there...</font>

109
00:07:13,030 --> 00:07:16,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The lights are out.
Even though it's not time for bed...</font>

110
00:07:22,380 --> 00:07:23,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this?!</font>

111
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:36,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's this?!</font>

112
00:07:43,190 --> 00:07:45,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What in the world is this?!</font>

113
00:07:57,580 --> 00:07:59,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uncle... Aunt...</font>

114
00:08:04,250 --> 00:08:06,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Father... Mother...!</font>

115
00:08:17,180 --> 00:08:19,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Father? Mother?</font>

116
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:22,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aren't you here?</font>

117
00:08:57,340 --> 00:08:58,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's somebody here!</font>

118
00:09:07,440 --> 00:09:08,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Move!</font>

119
00:09:09,690 --> 00:09:10,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Move!</font>

120
00:09:12,150 --> 00:09:13,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Move!</font>

121
00:09:26,540 --> 00:09:28,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Father! Mother!</font>

122
00:09:54,530 --> 00:09:55,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nii-san!</font>

123
00:09:55,990 --> 00:09:58,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nii-san!
Father and Mother are...!</font>

124
00:09:59,070 --> 00:10:01,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why? For what reason?!</font>

125
00:10:01,990 --> 00:10:03,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who in the world would do
something like this...?</font>

126
00:10:09,500 --> 00:10:11,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nii-san... What are you...?</font>

127
00:10:28,480 --> 00:10:30,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing,
nii-san!</font>

128
00:10:31,560 --> 00:10:33,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Foolish younger brother...</font>

129
00:10:42,370 --> 00:10:43,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mangekyo Sharingan!</font>

130
00:11:01,680 --> 00:11:02,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My legs...!</font>

131
00:11:15,570 --> 00:11:17,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop!</font>

132
00:11:17,360 --> 00:11:18,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nii-san!</font>

133
00:11:18,860 --> 00:11:21,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't make me see this!</font>

134
00:11:23,700 --> 00:11:24,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why...?</font>

135
00:11:25,490 --> 00:11:27,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why did you, nii-san...?!</font>

136
00:11:27,580 --> 00:11:29,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No...!</font>

137
00:11:29,790 --> 00:11:31,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No...</font>

138
00:11:37,340 --> 00:11:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aunt! Uncle!</font>

139
00:11:44,640 --> 00:11:46,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Father! Mother!</font>

140
00:11:46,640 --> 00:11:48,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop it! Nii-san!</font>

141
00:11:49,770 --> 00:11:51,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't kill Father and Mother!</font>

142
00:12:36,650 --> 00:12:37,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Why...</font>

143
00:12:39,570 --> 00:12:42,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why did you...? Nii-san...?</font>

144
00:12:46,780 --> 00:12:50,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To measure my abilities...</font>

145
00:12:51,620 --> 00:12:56,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Measure your abilities...?
Just for that?</font>

146
00:13:01,710 --> 00:13:03,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you saying that...</font>

147
00:13:04,470 --> 00:13:07,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just for that...
you killed them all?</font>

148
00:13:10,010 --> 00:13:12,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is of great importance.</font>

149
00:13:14,310 --> 00:13:16,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean...?</font>

150
00:13:20,230 --> 00:13:22,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't talk rubbish!</font>

151
00:13:53,350 --> 00:13:54,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm scared...</font>

152
00:13:55,350 --> 00:13:56,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm scared!</font>

153
00:14:11,200 --> 00:14:13,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't kill me...!</font>

154
00:14:30,390 --> 00:14:31,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">D-Don't kill me!</font>

155
00:14:32,810 --> 00:14:36,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are not even worth killing...</font>

156
00:14:37,850 --> 00:14:40,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Foolish younger brother...</font>

157
00:14:41,440 --> 00:14:46,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you want to kill me, begrudge me!
Hate me!</font>

158
00:14:46,990 --> 00:14:50,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And keep on surviving in
that unsightly manner...</font>

159
00:14:51,530 --> 00:14:55,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just continue fleeing and fleeing
and hang onto your life!</font>

160
00:15:18,390 --> 00:15:19,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shall we go outside...?</font>

161
00:15:21,940 --> 00:15:24,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These guys aren't just anybody...</font>

162
00:15:30,700 --> 00:15:34,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Itachi-san, it'll be a pain in the neck
if this kid moves around and...</font>

163
00:15:34,700 --> 00:15:37,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Maybe I better chop off
a leg just in case...</font>

164
00:15:39,710 --> 00:15:41,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What did he say?!</font>

165
00:15:47,920 --> 00:15:49,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then...</font>

166
00:16:01,940 --> 00:16:03,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Long time no see...</font>

167
00:16:08,400 --> 00:16:09,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke.</font>

168
00:16:10,360 --> 00:16:13,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uchiha Itachi!</font>

169
00:16:14,360 --> 00:16:16,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uchiha... Itachi?</font>

170
00:16:21,500 --> 00:16:24,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The same as Sasuke...
An Uchiha...</font>

171
00:16:28,840 --> 00:16:31,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh... Sharingan...</font>

172
00:16:32,010 --> 00:16:34,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And moreover,
he resembles you a lot...</font>

173
00:16:35,970 --> 00:16:37,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who the hell is he?</font>

174
00:16:39,560 --> 00:16:42,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's my younger brother.</font>

175
00:16:45,850 --> 00:16:50,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I heard that the entire Uchiha clan
had been murdered.</font>

176
00:16:51,940 --> 00:16:53,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By you.</font>

177
00:16:55,530 --> 00:16:59,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uchiha Itachi... I will kill you!</font>

178
00:17:04,040 --> 00:17:08,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I must kill one certain man
without fail!</font>

179
00:17:09,880 --> 00:17:11,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That man...</font>

180
00:17:14,470 --> 00:17:16,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My brother...</font>

181
00:17:16,760 --> 00:17:25,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought I couldn't die...
without killing him, but...</font>

182
00:17:27,520 --> 00:17:29,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the guy that Sasuke
was saying...</font>

183
00:17:29,690 --> 00:17:31,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The man he wanted to kill...</font>

184
00:17:48,580 --> 00:17:50,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's just as you said...</font>

185
00:17:51,500 --> 00:17:54,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I held a grudge against you
and hated you.</font>

186
00:17:55,510 --> 00:17:58,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For the singular purpose of
killing you, I...</font>

187
00:18:02,430 --> 00:18:03,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I...</font>

188
00:18:05,060 --> 00:18:06,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">have lived my life!</font>

189
00:18:07,440 --> 00:18:08,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke...!</font>

190
00:18:14,230 --> 00:18:15,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chidori...?</font>

191
00:18:15,740 --> 00:18:18,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will kill you!</font>

192
00:18:26,870 --> 00:18:28,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die!</font>

193
00:18:53,820 --> 00:18:56,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's going on?!</font>

194
00:18:56,900 --> 00:19:00,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't believe that Sasuke's Jutsu
was so easily thwarted...</font>

195
00:19:02,280 --> 00:19:03,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This doesn't look good!</font>

196
00:19:04,660 --> 00:19:06,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've got to do something!</font>

197
00:19:11,000 --> 00:19:14,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chakra permeates the air...</font>

198
00:19:15,210 --> 00:19:16,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

199
00:19:16,880 --> 00:19:19,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So this is the Nine-Tailed Fox Chakra!</font>

200
00:19:19,380 --> 00:19:20,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You jerk!</font>

201
00:19:20,300 --> 00:19:21,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're in the way!</font>

202
00:19:23,890 --> 00:19:25,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

203
00:19:25,560 --> 00:19:27,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

204
00:19:27,270 --> 00:19:28,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Summo...</font>

205
00:19:28,730 --> 00:19:29,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're too slow!</font>

206
00:19:32,560 --> 00:19:35,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...? I can't feel the Chakra...</font>

207
00:19:36,320 --> 00:19:39,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! Damn! Why is it?!</font>

208
00:19:40,240 --> 00:19:42,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My sword Shark Skin
has the ability to...</font>

209
00:19:42,570 --> 00:19:46,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">cut through and eat Chakra!</font>

210
00:19:50,830 --> 00:19:52,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a pain in the neck</font>

211
00:19:52,540 --> 00:19:54,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if the kid moves around
and uses Jutsu like that...</font>

212
00:19:55,000 --> 00:19:57,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Before these legs...</font>

213
00:19:57,170 --> 00:19:59,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Should I chop off these arms?</font>

214
00:20:04,470 --> 00:20:06,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why doesn't it emerge?!</font>

215
00:20:06,930 --> 00:20:08,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's pointless...</font>

216
00:20:25,570 --> 00:20:26,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

217
00:20:35,630 --> 00:20:39,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys just don't know me much,
do you?</font>

218
00:20:40,550 --> 00:20:44,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This man Jiraiya does not fall victim
to any woman's allurement,</font>

219
00:20:44,720 --> 00:20:47,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but rather his forte is
winning women's affection!</font>

220
00:20:48,510 --> 00:20:52,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not made to blindly follow after
a woman's feminine charm!</font>

221
00:20:53,520 --> 00:20:56,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When you get to my level,</font>

222
00:20:56,150 --> 00:21:01,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">women yelp with delight
at my sex appeal!</font>

223
00:21:09,670 --> 00:21:14,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">gaman no renzoku dattaro</font></font></b></font>

224
00:21:09,670 --> 00:21:14,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">a cycle of hardship, right?</font></font></b></font>

225
00:21:14,630 --> 00:21:19,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">kokoro de naiteita ndarou</font></font></b></font>

226
00:21:14,630 --> 00:21:19,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">inside, we were crying, right?</font></font></b></font>

227
00:21:19,680 --> 00:21:27,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">jibun de kimeta sono yume dake wa yuzurenai ndarou</font></font></b></font>

228
00:21:19,680 --> 00:21:27,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">but the one thing we won't give up is the dream we've chosen, right?</font></font></b></font>

229
00:21:27,730 --> 00:21:30,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">wakiyaku dakedo</font></font></b></font>

230
00:21:27,730 --> 00:21:30,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">it's a secondary role</font></font></b></font>

231
00:21:33,540 --> 00:21:36,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">kage no hito dakedo</font></font></b></font>

232
00:21:33,540 --> 00:21:36,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">a role in the shadows</font></font></b></font>

233
00:21:36,940 --> 00:21:41,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">yume to mukiau toki kurai</font></font></b></font>

234
00:21:36,940 --> 00:21:41,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">but in reaching for that dream</font></font></b></font>

235
00:21:42,080 --> 00:21:47,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">man naka ni isasete shoujiki ni isasete</font></font></b></font>

236
00:21:42,080 --> 00:21:47,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">let us stay centered, let us stay true</font></font></b></font>

237
00:21:47,920 --> 00:21:52,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">ima made nandomo nan toka akiramezu ni</font></font></b></font>

238
00:21:47,920 --> 00:21:52,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">over and over, we hung on without giving up</font></font></b></font>

239
00:21:52,690 --> 00:21:57,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">ima made nandomo tachi agatte kita janai ka</font></font></b></font>

240
00:21:52,690 --> 00:21:57,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">over and over, we kept coming back up</font></font></b></font>

241
00:21:57,390 --> 00:21:59,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">ima made nandomo</font></font></b></font>

242
00:21:57,390 --> 00:22:07,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">over and over, we believed and dreamed</font></font></b></font>

243
00:21:59,700 --> 00:22:00,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">bokura</font></font></b></font>

244
00:22:00,630 --> 00:22:02,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">nandomo</font></font></b></font>

245
00:22:02,000 --> 00:22:03,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">shinjite</font></font></b></font>

246
00:22:03,230 --> 00:22:04,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">nandomo</font></font></b></font>

247
00:22:04,570 --> 00:22:07,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">yume mite nandomo</font></font></b></font>

248
00:22:07,510 --> 00:22:12,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">ima made nandomo baka o mite kita janai ka</font></font></b></font>

249
00:22:07,510 --> 00:22:12,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">over and over, we've seen fools</font></font></b></font>

250
00:22:12,710 --> 00:22:17,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">ima made nandomo hito no kage ni tatte kita janai ka</font></font></b></font>

251
00:22:12,710 --> 00:22:17,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">over and over, we've stood in the shadows of others</font></font></b></font>

252
00:22:19,750 --> 00:22:29,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">saa shuyaku da yo jibun no yume kurai wagamama de isasete</font></font></b></font>

253
00:22:19,750 --> 00:22:29,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">now, it's our turn... let us bask in our dreams</font></font></b></font>

254
00:22:37,500 --> 00:22:38,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Watch out, Sasuke!</font>

255
00:22:38,960 --> 00:22:40,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Naruto, don't help him.</font>

256
00:22:41,000 --> 00:22:42,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">But... Sasuke is!</font>

257
00:22:43,000 --> 00:22:48,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">It is your duty to watch
through this battle, Naruto.</font>

258
00:22:49,760 --> 00:22:50,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What?!</font>

259
00:22:50,930 --> 00:22:52,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">This is his fight...</font>

260
00:22:52,850 --> 00:22:57,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">This represents everything that
he has been carrying up to now.</font>

261
00:22:58,060 --> 00:23:02,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Foolish Younger Brother. Hate, Detest!"</font>

